*?ImageableArea: "
  save
  /cvp {cvi (                   ) cvs
  print ( ) print} bind def
  newpath clippath pathbbox
  4 -2 roll exch 2 {ceiling cvp} repeat
  exch 2 {floor cvp} repeat ( )
  = flush restore"
*End

